 "provenance_html": "<p>Source: <code>synthegra/results/pid_synergy_nsweep_resolution.csv</code> (script <code>experiments/pid_synergy_nsweep.py</code>, commit 0f0dadd), the numbers behind figure 5 of the manuscript. Planted structure: two modalities, K = 16 latent factors, R/S/U = 0.1/0.3/0.6, two cross-modal interaction pairs with strength \u03bb = 10. Synergy is estimated with the robust BROJA estimator on the oracle latent blocks (<code>compute_broja_pid_multidim_robust</code>, occupancy binning, null-corrected), 96 seeds per cohort size. Points are single seeds; the band is the 2.5\u201397.5 % range across seeds. Synergy estimates are lower bounds.</p>"
